1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,720
If you flew close enough to a black hole,

2
00:00:02,760 --> 00:00:04,930
you could travel into the future.

3
00:00:04,970 --> 00:00:08,190
You'd watch your clock tick for just one hour.

4
00:00:08,230 --> 00:00:09,430
But back on Earth,

5
00:00:09,470 --> 00:00:11,480
years could be passing.

6
00:00:11,520 --> 00:00:13,180
And when you finally returned,

7
00:00:13,220 --> 00:00:14,940
your friends would be old.

8
00:00:15,290 --> 00:00:17,430
Your family might already be gone.

9
00:00:17,950 --> 00:00:20,750
Because you didn't just travel through space.

10
00:00:20,790 --> 00:00:22,310
You traveled through time.

